<title>UK: Wickes appoints Simpson non-exec director.</title>
<headline>Wickes appoints Simpson non-exec director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Troubled British do-it-yourself retailer Wickes Plc said on Thursday that David Simpson had been appointed to the board as a non-executive director.</p>
<p>Simpson recently retired from Standard Life Assurance Company where he was a general manager and secretary between 1988 and 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
